      "title": "Alias admission against the source in the node-proposal service",
      "summary": "A node proposal now records only the aliases whose normalized form occurs in the normalized content of its run's raw information, exempts directed runs, and names each refused alias with ALIAS_NOT_IN_SOURCE in the service result.",
      "task": "task/alias-admission/admit-aliases-from-source"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/alias-admission/default-prompt-version-v5",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/alias-admission/default-prompt-version-v5.md",
      "title": "Default prompt version moves to v5",
      "summary": "DEFAULT_PROMPT_VERSION is now bound to the v5 module's PROMPT_VERSION, so an ingest_document call that names no prompt version opens its run under v5.",
      "task": "task/alias-admission/default-prompt-version-v5"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/alias-admission/prompt-v5-asks-for-other-names",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/alias-admission/prompt-v5-asks-for-other-names.md",
      "title": "Extraction prompt v5 asks for other names",
      "summary": "Registers a v5 extraction prompt module composed over v4 that adds an instruction to propose every other name the text gives each entity, and leaves v1 to v4 and the default version untouched.",
      "task": "task/alias-admission/prompt-v5-asks-for-other-names"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/alias-admission/admit-aliases-from-source",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/alias-admission/admit-aliases-from-source.md",
      "title": "Proof for alias admission against the source in the node-proposal service",
      "summary": "Service-level tests, over an in-memory stand-in for the store, that a node proposal records only aliases the source holds (directed runs exempt), names each refused alias with ALIAS_NOT_IN_SOURCE, adds only aliases to a matched node, and lets an admitted alias resolve a later proposal. No test runs the admission SQL against PostgreSQL.",
      "task": "task/alias-admission/admit-aliases-from-source"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/alias-admission/default-prompt-version-v5",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/alias-admission/default-prompt-version-v5.md",
      "title": "Proof that the default prompt version is v5",
      "summary": "A document ingestion that names no prompt version opens its run under the literal v5 and an explicit version is still honored. The v1 to v5 enumeration is decided by one test, and the stale assertion that the default is v4 is removed.",
      "task": "task/alias-admission/default-prompt-version-v5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/alias-admission/prompt-v5-asks-for-other-names",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/alias-admission/prompt-v5-asks-for-other-names.md",
      "title": "Proof for extraction prompt v5 asking for other names",
      "summary": "Tests that v5 is a held prompt version whose system prompt asks for every other name of an entity and keeps all of v4, that v4 and v5 carry the relative-date instructions, and that v1 to v4 ask for no other names.",
      "task": "task/alias-admission/prompt-v5-asks-for-other-names"
    }
  ],
